//- #2469: "Multi Board Calendar" - Planyway-style calendar showing due/
//- start/end/received dates for cards across EVERY board the current user
//- is a member of, not just the currently open board. Reuses the single-
//- board Calendar view's FullCalendar rendering (+fullcalendar, the same
//- fc-* CSS in calendarView.css) and #4223 Bigboard's all-boards
//- subscription/query pattern (bigboardQuery in bigboardView.js) for the
//- card set. Each event is prefixed with its board's title so entries from
//- different boards stay distinguishable, and clicking an event opens that
//- card the same way the single-board Calendar view already does.
template(name="multiboardCalendarView")
  .calendar-view.multiboard-calendar-view.swimlane.dragscroll
    if isLoading
      p.quiet {{_ 'loading'}}
    else
      +fullcalendar(multiboardCalendarOptions)
